# Proposal — accept/reject 2026-02-10 vendor capability bulletin

Status: PROPOSED (not accepted; prepared by planning agent)
Candidate: `/run/f1/inbox/2026-02-10/vendor-capabilities.csv`
SHA-256: 0e997...
Proposed canonical path: `sources/vendor-capabilities.csv` (exact bytes)
Current canonical digest: f815...
Effect: V3 min_c -10 -> 0. All other rows unchanged. This removes the only coastal-rated vendor that meets Site B's -4°C requirement; under the candidate, no vendor is compliant for Site B. It does not affect A (V1) or C (V3 still 0≤2, 750mm).
Requested decision: independent operator to compare digest and either accept exact bytes via authorised intake or reject. This proposal does not accept it and does not change canonical sources.
Decision/record: pending.
